    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks. I'm also curious about the subgrade. We're worried the compaction wasn't uniform across the whole stretch. How much does the stability of the subgrade affect the longevity of the surface layer when you're dealing with these high temp fluctuations?",
